              "sample": "I find new opportunities mostly through WeChat class groups and Xiaohongshu posts students share. People forward competition ads or part-time jobs, and short Douyin clips pop up too. I do a quick scroll daily but double-check on official sites before signing up. It is noisy yet fast — handy if you verify.",
