              "sample": "I miss the excitement of hands-on science labs — colour changes and messy notes felt more alive than slides. Our group reports sometimes failed in funny ways, but we laughed and fixed them. We had labs about monthly, heavier near exams. Life felt simpler then, and I still smile when I remember.",
