              "sample": "It's best known for cheap, tasty food — a lively night market and even our high school canteen people still talk about. Takeaways arrive by phone after nine, and the smell of snacks fills the street on weekends. It gets busy every weekend night, especially during festivals. The place feels welcoming and hard to forget.",
