              "sample": "Definitely yes — nearly every city I have visited keeps some snack streets or morning fairs. My hometown lane sells regional dishes from family recipes at affordable prices. Locals and tourists mix on busy evenings and holiday peaks. I feel proud of that local taste and glad it stays affordable.",
