              "sample": "It's busy but convenient — a commuter area with shops around the subway hub. Morning rush fills the street, though weekends are calmer and late-night stores stay open. I feel that rhythm every weekday. It's lively and practical; I've got used to the noise.",
              "sampleZh": "热闹但方便——地铁商圈，上班上学的人流多。早高峰街面挤，周末安静些，夜里便利店也开着。工作日每天感受这个节奏。有烟火气也务实，噪音习惯了就好。",
              "sampleOk": true,
              "logic": "先答区域气质偏便利、略吵，再举地铁商圈与通勤人流，补工作日体验与务实感受。",
