              "sample": "The area where I live is green and relaxed, not right in the city centre — old and new buildings sit around a nearby park that works like lungs for the block. Elders do tai chi mornings; students walk evenings like me. I'm there most evenings and sometimes weekend picnics. The pace feels pleasant, breathable and balanced.",
