              "sample": "Not very often — maybe once or twice a year when my sneakers are clearly worn out. I don't chase fashion, and a decent pair can last a full term or more. After exams I usually check the soles, then buy online or at a nearby mall. It saves money and I don't waste time comparing styles every month.",
