              "sample": "Rarely — in the city I might see a few bright stars on clear winter nights, almost never in summer haze. Late study keeps me indoors, but if I finish early I step outside and try to spot Orion. That lucky moment comes a few times a winter. It reminds me of science class and feels like a small reward.",
              "sampleZh": "很少——城里只有冬天天晴时能看到几颗亮的，夏天雾霾几乎看不到。学习常弄到很晚，但提早结束我会出门试着找猎户座。冬天运气好才有几次。让我想起科学课，像一点小奖励。",
