              "sample": "I think people should avoid full noise cancelling when they ride a bike or stand near the edge of a subway platform. If you cannot hear announcements or a horn, small mistakes can become dangerous. Drivers should not wear earbuds at all — that is illegal in many places. I sometimes leave one ear out on the train; music can wait when safety matters.",
