              "sample": "I think space travel will get safer and use more technology than in the past. Science class showed how new materials and better machines could support longer trips and teamwork across countries. That may help medicine and weather satellites, and push schools to teach more science. I feel hopeful — it takes time, but it is worth studying for.",
