              "sample": "Street markets now use QR payments and even live streams, while malls add fine fruit sections upstairs. Ten years ago many stalls were cash-only with less variety and traceability. Community group buying fills fridges, yet Sunday markets still feel lively. I trust stalls with honest quality and glad the heritage is kept in a modern way.",
              "sampleZh": "街市能扫码甚至直播卖货，商场楼上也有精品水果区。十年前不少摊只收现金，品种和溯源都弱些。社区团购会填满冰箱，但周日市集依旧热闹。我信口碑好的摊位，也高兴老传统换了新方式还在。",
              "sampleOk": true,
