              "sample": "I usually prefer travelling with other people, especially on trains where plans are easier to share. With friends we split costs, chat on the ride, and feel safer arriving at a new station at night. Travelling alone is more flexible, but long rides can feel a bit lonely. Overall I feel happier with company on most trips.",
